<view class="page-shell {{_roleThemeClass}}">
  <view class="container meeting-page">
    <view class="page-hero">
      <view class="page-hero-title">会议</view>
      <view class="meeting-hero-hint">会议在腾讯会议/课堂等外部开好，在此登记时间与链接，便于结对双方查看；不替代腾讯建会。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="meeting-bar" wx:if="{{canCreate}}">
      <button class="btn-primary meeting-btn-new" size="default" bindtap="onCreate">新建会议</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card meeting-next-card" wx:if="{{nextMeeting}}">
      <view class="meeting-next-tag">下一场</view>
      <view class="meeting-next-title">{{nextMeeting.title}}</view>
      <view class="desc" wx:if="{{nextMeeting.pairLine}}">{{nextMeeting.pairLine}}</view>
      <view class="desc">{{nextMeeting.startTime}}</view>
      <view class="desc" wx:if="{{nextMeeting.roomLink}}">链接：{{nextMeeting.roomLink}}</view>
      <view class="desc" style="color: #98a2b3" wx:else>尚未填写链接：请在腾讯会议中复制会邀，回到本小程序「新建会议」编辑同一条，或下一场新建时填上</view>
      <view class="actions">
        <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{!nextMeeting.roomLink}}" bindtap="onCopyLink">复制链接</button>
        <button class="btn-secondary" bindtap="onSubscribeNotice">提醒</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section-header" wx:if="{{!empty}}">
      <view class="section-title">历史</view>
    </view>
    <view class="card meeting-history-card" wx:if="{{history && history.length}}">
      <block wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="list-row">
          <view>
            <view class="meeting-history-title">{{item.title}}</view>
            <view class="desc" wx:if="{{item.pairLine}}">{{item.pairLine}}</view>
            <view class="desc">{{item.startTime}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="badge badge-success">{{item.status || '已结束'}}</view>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="card" wx:if="{{empty}}" style="margin-top: 20rpx">
      <view class="section-desc" style="text-align: center; color: #667085; padding: 20rpx 0;">
        暂无已登记的会议。可点上方「新建会议」添加。
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
